ght:700;letter-spacing:6px;color:#061a39\">{{ .Token }}</p><p>This code expires shortly. Never share it with anyone.</p><p style=\"margin:23px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#061a39\">See you on court,<br><strong>The Rallora team</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 26px;border-top:1px solid #e4edf5;background:#f8fbfe;text-align:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75;color:#58718a\">For account help, contact support@rallora.app. Never share your password or verification code.</td></tr></table><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#6b8093;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 0\"><strong style=\"color:#061a39\">Your club. Your league.</strong><br>Rallora · Play. Connect. Progress.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "mailer_subjects_password_changed_notification": "Your Rallora password was changed",
